+`~/.local/share/com.memrynote.memry`, logs `~/.local/share/com.memrynote.memry/logs`. A run through
+`launch-tauri` uses the control-file dirs instead.
+
+Faithful: the Windows guest runs the native arm64 build (no Prism), WebView2 is the real engine,
+and WebKitGTK arm64 on the Ubuntu VM is the real engine with no Rosetta. Paths, file locks, the
